	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "Everlight PLR135/T TOSLINK optical receiver (Akizuki 109595, 150 yen). Through-hole, hand-soldered / not JLC-assembled. Land pattern per datasheet DPL-0000018_Rev.4 p6 \"PCB Layout for Electrical Circuit\": 3 signal pins phi0.80 at 2.54mm pitch, 2 mounting holes phi3.20 at 7.62mm spacing, 3.95mm from the signal row, signal row centred between the mounting holes. PIN FUNCTION: 1=Vcc 2=GND 3=Vout. Body approx 11.5 x 11.3mm, height 19.5mm; the mounting holes and the optical barrel are both on the +Y (front) side: body spans -0.35mm (behind the pin row) to +10.95mm (front face), 11.30mm deep and is meant to overhang the board edge.")
